Trakhtman (1983) showed that every semigroup with at most five elements is finitely based (Drensky's
survey, Theorems 6.2 and 6.3). Source: E. I. Khukhro and V. D. Mazurov (eds.), Unsolved Problems in
Group Theory: The Kourovka Notebook, 21st issue, arXiv:1401.0300v49 (2026), Archive of Solved
